ld:true,italic:false,color:gold},"\n",{text:"Sentinel",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:15}}],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Artist",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Artist"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Once per game, during the day, privately ask the Storyteller any yes/no question."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Philosopher",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Philosopher"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Once per game, at night, choose a good character: gain that ability. If this character is in play, they are drunk."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Professor",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Professor"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Once per game, at night*, choose a dead player: if they are a Townsfolk, they are resurrected."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Seamstress",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Seamstress"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Once per game, at night, choose 2 players (not yourself): you learn if they are the same alignment."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Slayer",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Slayer"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"Once per game, during the day, publicly choose a player: if they are the Demon, they die."],["","      ",{text:"TOWNSFOLK",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Virgin",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Virgin"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"The 1st time you are nominated, if the nominator is a Townsfolk, they are executed immediately."],["","      ",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Klutz",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Klutz"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"When you learn that you died, publicly choose 1 alive player: if they are evil, your team loses."],["","      ",{text:"OUTSIDER",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Moonchild",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Moonchild"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"When you learn that you died, publicly choose 1 alive player. Tonight, if it was a good player, they die."],["","      ",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Evil Twin",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Evil%20Twin"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"You & an opposing player know each other. If the good player is executed, evil wins. Good can't win if you both live."],["","      ",{text:"MINION",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Mastermind",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Mastermind"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"If the Demon dies by execution (ending the game), play for 1 more day. If a player is then executed, their team loses."],["","      ",{text:"DEMON",bold:true,italic:false,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Pukka",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Pukka"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"Each night, choose a player: they are poisoned. The previously poisoned player dies then becomes healthy."],["","      ",{text:"FABLED",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",{text:"Sentinel",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gold,click_event:{action:open_url,url:"https://wiki.bloodontheclocktower.com/Sentinel"}},{text:":\n",italic:false,color:gold},"There might be 1 extra or 1 fewer Outsider in play."]],title:"",author:""},custom_name={text:"On Thin Ice Script",bold:true,italic:false,underlined:true,color:blue},lore=[{text:"Useful role cheat sheet for ",italic:false,color:gray},[{text:"On Thin Ice",italic:false,color:blue},{text:" script.",italic:false,color:gray}]]]